#   category  a _BASE_CATEGORIES name, or None for "this controller's OWN
#              page" (pads.display_name(kind)), which is per-controller.
#   opener    method name popping that page's cog modal on arrival, or None.
#   tooltip   what the page owns; None means a dedicated builder supplies it
#              (the gyro's, which quotes the live mode/output).
